note sh_mix_width: a uint value shifted by a ulong amount: 31 (the width - 1) is fine, 32 (the width) traps 7
note (exit 107). "w\n" comes first; exit 1 would mean the shift by 31 gave a wrong value.
text t "w\n"
fn shu a uint s ulong to uint
ret shl a s
end
fn main to int
w = write 1 t 0 2
x = shu 1 31
if ne x 2147483648
ret 1
end
y = shu 1 32
ret int and y 255
end
